  (text "One 8.4 V input, centre-positive, 2 A: mains PSU, MPPT solar or the crank converter."
    (at 20.32 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid "16f8cb47-1c6b-5d9a-819e-145305eb2455"))
  (text "The 16 mm switch is LATCHING and sits in the charge lead; its LED is fed from UPS_5V."
    (at 20.32 158.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid "75607315-e804-533b-b665-2c43db92601f"))
  (text "BATT_2S_P carries the 5 A BLX-A fuse. CHG_SENSE taps CHG_8V4: open switch = no source."
    (at 20.32 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid "19192ffe-0232-5fba-b564-a2d3e26db6fe"))
  (text "UPS_5V leaves on soldered 20-22 AWG wires to the Pi; this board is its only supply."
